# brand-gate

## Setup

This project uses a project-local virtual environment (`.venv`) so its
packages live with the project, not your system Python.

```bash
python3 -m venv .venv          # create the project's own interpreter
source .venv/bin/activate      # activate it (run in each new terminal session)
pip install -r requirements.txt
```

Point your IDE's Python interpreter at `.venv/bin/python` so the IDE and
terminal run the exact same Python.
